{"id":"629398","name":"茶叶蛋","author":"敏zhu","authorId":"9037209","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629398/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红茶","amount":"一包"},{"name":"八角","amount":"两个"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"两张"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"几粒"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"几个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料放入奶锅。","img":"images/629398/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入清水，烧开。","img":"images/629398/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋备好。","img":"images/629398/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"清洗干净。","img":"images/629398/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"烧开后，小火煮五分钟，加入盐。","img":"images/629398/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入生抽，继续煮五分钟。","img":"images/629398/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鸡蛋，小火再次煮开。","img":"images/629398/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"咕嘟大约十分钟，关火，焖着。","img":"images/629398/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"不烫手后给蛋壳敲碎，浸泡过夜。","img":"images/629398/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"美味的茶叶蛋。","img":"images/629398/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"茶叶蛋。","img":"images/629398/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"茶叶可以根据自己喜好换成乌龙或者搭配绿茶。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}